%% User shopping flow
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant API as API
    participant AG as Orchestrator
    U->>UI: "₹500 ke andar 1kg aloo, 100g mirch, 2 Maggi"
    UI->>API: GET /shopping-requests/stream/live?text=...
    API->>AG: parse + run (SSE)
    AG-->>UI: step: INTENT_PARSED
    AG-->>UI: step: SEARCHING / RANKING / OPTIMIZING
    AG-->>UI: step: BASKET_READY (₹89.24, within budget)
    AG-->>UI: step: CART_VERIFIED / CHECKOUT_READY
    AG-->>UI: step: PAYMENT_PROCESSING / ORDER_PLACED
    AG-->>UI: final: COMPLETED (Order ORD-XXXX)
    UI-->>U: Basket + order summary
